[sub_resource type="RoseDialogLine" id="RoseDialogLine_tuev0"]
text = "A few days ago, I was visited by a lone adventurer. He asked me to let him borrow Kirnale's Journals for exploring the Goblin Cave. I told him he can read them, but that I cannot let him borrow them. But he was just so stubborn that I eventually let him take them."
